            "review_title": "Review at Nhà hàng Quyết Thắng Dốc Lết",
            "review_text": "Josep L\n19 contributions\n2\nOnly eat here if you are really desperate\nJul 2017 • Family\nNo one speaks a word of English what would not be a problem if they would understand that the picture we pointed was actually what we ordered.\nAfter waiting for 1/2 hour, only the shrimps came, no fish, no scallops, no veggies.\n\nInstead of trying to explain that pointing at the picture of a fish, means that we want fish, we decided to point at our shrimps to get some more and it worked.\n\nWe are still wondering whether they bring shrimps, no matter what you order.\n\nAnd by the way, our drinks were blown away by the wind and we had to buy new ones. We recommend you to buy a coconut, since it is too heavy to be blown away.\n\nOnly eat here in case of real desperation and only if you are not allergic to shrimps.\nRead more\nWritten July 5, 2017",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-11",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
