            "review_title": "Review at Nhà hàng Quyết Thắng Dốc Lết",
            "review_text": "Jun B\n2 contributions\n0\nBest Place in Doc Let\nJul 2016 • Solo\nI went there for a three-day-trip. Quyet Thang has got a hotel with lots of room options, and a restaurant right next to the beach. I'd say: the whole area is paradise. And for a local feel and reasonable price, Quyet Thang is the one.\n\nThe room was pretty nice, spacious and airy. The receptionist was super smiley :).\n\nThe restaurant is huge, with lots of space and locates next to the beach. Basically I brought my beer and went straight to the beach to read books and enjoy the sun. \n\nThe food was nice. Fair price. Lots of options from Vietnamese to Western style. The chef even went to ask me if the dish was good haha.\n\nOverall it was the best experience I have had in Doc Let.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten July 17, 2016",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-11",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
